      "kind": "narration",
      "content": "The motion before us: This house would tax sugary drinks. Speaking for the proposition, Amara Okafor, emergency physician and public-health researcher; speaking against, Victor Hale, constitutional litigator.",
      "status": "complete",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:01.647Z"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chat",
      "debate": {
        "phase": "opening",
