      "kind": "narration",
      "content": "Proposition argued that a sugary-drink tax cuts consumption, spurs reformulation, and funds affected communities; Opposition argued it coerces, hits the poor hardest, and presumes alternatives that price alone cannot create. We now move to closing statements.",
